.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
renv/library/
renv/staging/
.DS_Store
work/
# analysis/output is TRACKED, on the Lab Director's instruction of 19 October that every
# visualization, table and diagram be versioned and reproducible from the repository. It previously
# read "analysis/output/*", which excluded every pooled estimate the manuscript quotes and every
# figure the pipeline draws: a reader could clone this repository and find the code that produces
# the numbers but not the numbers themselves, which is the opposite of what the other rules in this
# file are for. Those rules exclude licensed database exports and screening rows carrying export
# titles, none of which applies here. The directory is 104 KB of derived statistics across 17 files.
#
# Two exclusions remain inside it, both for things that are not results.
analysis/output/*.tmp
analysis/output/*.log
*.pdf.aux

# Exported bibliographic records: large, and licensed database content.
# The search log records the counts, strings and SHA-256 so the export is
# verifiable without redistributing Elsevier-licensed records in a public repo.
search/**/*.ris

# Per record dedup flags carry the export titles; counts live in RECALL_AND_DEDUP.md
search/**/*_dedup.csv

# Screener configuration names local models; the repository names none
search/screening/screener_config.json
search/screening/decisions_*.csv
search/screening/adjudication_*.csv
search/screening/*.log
# Full text pool per record rows carry export titles; the summary is committed
search/screening/fulltext_pool_*.csv
__pycache__/
search/screening/fulltext_access_*.csv
search/screening/fulltext_decisions_*.csv
search/screening/fulltext_adjudication_*.csv
search/screening/fulltext_resolution_*.csv
search/screening/fulltext_results_*.csv
search/screening/biomarker_scan_*.csv
